# =============================================================================
# Portfolio Contact Form Configuration (EmailJS)
# =============================================================================
# Follow these quick steps to connect your contact form:
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. In "Email Services", connect your Gmail account (usaimkhan24@gmail.com).
#    -> Copy the "Service ID" below.
# 3. In "Email Templates", create a new template:
#    - Subject: New Signal from {{first_name}} {{last_name}}
#    - Content:
#        Sender: {{first_name}} {{last_name}}
#        Email: {{email}}
#        Message:
#        {{message}}
#    - Set "To Email" to: usaimkhan24@gmail.com
#    - Set "Reply-To" to: {{reply_to}}
#    -> Copy the "Template ID" below.
# 4. In "Account" -> "Security" -> copy your "Public Key".
# 5. Create a .env file and paste your credentials:
# =============================================================================

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
